# Free token from https://ion.cesium.com (Access Tokens > Default Token).
# With it the simulator draws Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles (real photogrammetry of buildings,
# trees and roads; add the asset "Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles" to your ion account first).
# If those are unavailable it falls back to Cesium World Terrain + Bing imagery + OSM Buildings,
# and with no token at all to Esri satellite imagery and a simplified landmark model.
# Tip: restrict the token to your site's URL in the ion dashboard.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# Optional: force Cesium's own world (World Terrain + Bing + OSM Buildings) instead of Google's tiles.
# VITE_WORLD_SOURCE=cesium
